WEBVTT

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.476
(Applause and cheers)

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.934
Or ...

00:06:04.958 --> 00:06:10.726
what if heterosexual people
stood in front of LGBTQ issues?

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:14.851
(Applause and cheers)

00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:18.643
And what if able-bodied people advocated

00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:21.226
for people living with disabilities?

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:25.101
(Applause and cheers)

00:06:25.125 --> 00:06:27.768
You know, we can stand up for issues,

00:06:27.792 --> 00:06:30.101
weigh in and advocate